{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Gu2TABhTSADs5i89ioRany","type":"tool_result","content":"On June 28, 2012 the U.S. Supreme Court upheld the much debated 2010 healthcare law, declaring it constitutional. A Gallup poll released the day after this decision asked 1,012 Americans whether they agree with this decision. At a 95% confidence level, this sample has a 3% margin of error. The poll data is in the CSV file scotus_healthcare.csv.\n\nDetermine if the following statement is true or false. Please answer with \"true\" or \"false\".\nStatement: If we considered many random samples of 1,012 Americans, and we calculated the sample proportions of those who support the decision of the U.S. Supreme Court, 95% of those sample proportions will be between 43% and 49%.\n\nOptions:\ntrue\nfalse\nquestion.md\nscotus_healthcare.csv","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aa813eca-3148-4293-a066-f5784d2b95d7","uuid":"6d55440e-d3fd-4fb6-bb59-92942a51c289","timestamp":"2026-11-12T09:52:26.772Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"On June 28, 2012 the U.S. Supreme Court upheld the much debated 2010 healthcare law, declaring it constitutional. A Gallup poll released the day after this decision asked 1,012 Americans whether they agree with this decision. At a 95% confidence level, this sample has a 3% margin of error. The poll data is in the CSV file scotus_healthcare.csv.\n\nDetermine if the following statement is true or false. Please answer with \"true\" or \"false\".\nStatement: If we considered many random samples of 1,012 Americans, and we calculated the sample proportions of those who support the decision of the U.S. Supreme Court, 95% of those sample proportions will be between 43% and 49%.\n\nOptions:\ntrue\nfalse\nquestion.md\nscotus_healthcare.csv","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Gu2TABhTSADs5i89ioRany","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept"